ion":"1.0.2","download_link":"https://api.geode-sdk.org/v1/mods/ezkidtrix.attempt-labeler/versions/1.0.2/download","hash":"01e4e9af4435c47baa85a8e29cd57dc265bf42b52b9915f6fe94a23272ef887e","geode":"5.8.2","download_count":224,"early_load":false,"requires_patching":false,"api":false,"mod_id":"ezkidtrix.attempt-labeler","gd":{"win":"2.2081","android32":"2.2081","android64":"2.2081","mac-intel":"2.2081","mac-arm":"2.2081","ios":"2.2081"},"status":"accepted","created_at":"2026-08-15T22:12:56Z","updated_at":"2026-08-15T22:12:56Z"}],"tags":["gameplay","enhancement","customization","content","joke"],"about":"# Attempt Labeler\r\nA very simple geode mod that puts a label above the object that killed you. So, when you get back to that part you can have something to motivate to get further!\\\r\n**NOTE: if you pause the game, all the labels with be removed!**\r\n\r\n## How to edit labels\r\n1. Open the mod's save directory (typical paths are below)\\\r\n  *Win: \"%localappdata%\\GeometryDash\"*\\\r\n  *Mac: \"~/Library/Application Support/GeometryDash\"*\\\r\n  **it may be a different directory depending on your setup**\r\n2. Open the file named \"phrases.txt\"\r\n3. Either add new lines or change existing lines to whatever text you want\r\n4. Save the file and go into a level (or re-open the current level)","changelog":null,"created_at":"2026-08-16T00:00:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T02:11:04Z","links":{"community":null,"homepage":null,"source":"https://github.com/Ezkidtrix/attempt-labeler"}}